<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87787" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκηρ-ύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκήρ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>proclaim by herald, proclaim
				publicly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				461
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.37
			</span></i>, etc.: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὠνεῖσθαι τὸν βουλόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1350a20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. οἱ ἔφοροι κείρεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cleom.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόμον π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					684
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. στεφάνους τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.60.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀγοράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					4.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>advertise for sale,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἀγορὰν τὰ ὤνια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					8.103
				</span></i>
			 (v.l.); <i>put up to auction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEleph.</u>
					23.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				2112.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
